Sections.Body:
*   **Producer:** Agent Orchestrator
*   **Consumer:** AI Agent Microservices
*   **Communication Protocol:** Kafka topic `incident.created`
*   **JSON Schema:**
    ```json
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "title": "IncidentCreatedEvent",
      "description": "Event published when a new incident is ingested.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "incident_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Unique identifier for the incident."
        },
        "itsm_ticket_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ID from the external ITSM system."
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Detailed description of the incident."
        },
        "timestamp": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time",
          "description": "Timestamp of when the incident was created."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "incident_id",
        "itsm_ticket_id",
        "description",
        "timestamp"
      ]
    }
    ```

*   **Producer:** AI Agent Microservices
*   **Consumer:** Agent Orchestrator, other AI Agent Microservices (for chained actions)
*   **Communication Protocol:** Kafka topic `agent.action.taken`
*   **JSON Schema:**
    ```json
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "title": "AgentActionTakenEvent",
      "description": "Event published when an AI agent performs an action (diagnosis, resolution, etc.).",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "action_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Unique identifier for the agent action."
        },
        "incident_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ID of the incident related to the action."
        },
        "agent_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ID of the AI agent that performed the action."
        },
        "action_type": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Type of action performed (e.g., Diagnosis, Resolution, Escalation).
          "enum": ["Diagnosis", "Resolution", "Escalation", "InformationGathering"]
        },
        "details": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "JSON object containing action-specific details.",
          "additionalProperties": true
        },
        "timestamp": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time",
          "description": "Timestamp of when the action was taken."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "action_id",
        "incident_id",
        "agent_id",
        "action_type",
        "details",
        "timestamp"
      ]
    }
    ```

*   **Producer:** AI Agent Microservices
*   **Consumer:** LLM Inference Microservice
*   **Communication Protocol:** Kafka topic `llm.inference.request`
*   **JSON Schema:**
    ```json
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "title": "LLMInferenceRequestEvent",
      "description": "Event published to request LLM inference.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "request_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Unique identifier for the inference request."
        },
        "incident_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ID of the incident related to the inference."
        },
        "prompt": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "The prompt text for the LLM."
        },
        "context_vectors": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "description": "Optional vector embeddings for RAG."
        },
        "timestamp": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time",
          "description": "Timestamp of the request."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "request_id",
        "incident_id",
        "prompt",
        "timestamp"
      ]
    }
    ```

*   **Producer:** LLM Inference Microservice
*   **Consumer:** AI Agent Microservices
*   **Communication Protocol:** Kafka topic `llm.inference.response`
*   **JSON Schema:**
    ```json
    {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "title": "LLMInferenceResponseEvent",
      "description": "Event published with the result of LLM inference.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "request_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ID of the original inference request."
        },
        "incident_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ID of the incident related to the inference."
        },
        "response": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "The LLM's generated response."
        },
        "timestamp": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time",
          "description": "Timestamp of the response."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "request_id",
        "incident_id",
        "response",
        "timestamp"
      ]
    }
    ```
